RELAXED_BOX 71.8917013547852 71.8918271078772 71.8924427317491

# These formulas define the derivatives w.r.t. strain components
# Constants uses $, variables use v_
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-${pxx0})/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1--151.476886903599)/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1--151.476886903599)/(v_delta/v_len0)*0.0001
